ProjectGuessr mod — GPL-3.0-or-later
====================================

This mod reuses Minecraft's built-in panorama capture and follows the same
approach as the GPL-3.0 "panorama-screenshot" mod
(https://github.com/Fridtjof-DE/PanoramaScreenshot), so it is distributed under
the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later.

You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License along with
this program. If not, see <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt>.

The full license text is available at the URL above. Replace this file with the
complete GPL-3.0 text before distributing binaries.
